      "status": "preserved"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "Apple discourages using this method in iOS 15, tvOS 15, macOS 12, and watchOS 8 or later.",
      "ko": "Apple은 iOS 15, tvOS 15 및 macOS 12 이상에서 이 메서드 사용을 권장하지 않습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "a43b5778b9e46b3af59b8b30849435653fc2f65a038607993cbafc4f92c2523c",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0002",
      "source": "Load associated tracks asynchronously using [`loadAssociatedTracks(ofType:completionHandler:)`](avassettrack/loadassociatedtracks(oftype:completionhandler:).md) instead.",
      "ko": "대신 [`loadMetadata(for:completionHandler:)`](avassettrack/loadmetadata(for:completionhandler:).md)로 트랙 메타데이터를 비동기적으로 로드합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "94dc3cf6d1b613ee8e4e109653ff512676848646bfc5bba46d3ae8ec2902295f",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0001",
      "source": "You can call this method without blocking the current thread after you’ve loaded the [`availableTrackAssociationTypes`](avassettrack/availabletrackassociationtypes.md) property.",
      "ko": "[`availableMetadataFormats`](avassettrack/availablemetadataformats.md) 속성을 로드한 후에는 현재 스레드를 차단하지 않고 이 메서드를 호출할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "6555cde1b5aa87e3ae3caadc731b4ef3d2bdb66fc738e6424bbe1671cfef7b43",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
